+                                                [X], [y] with 1 * alpha.
+    It is the same alpha as the average loss stays the same.
+    For wide X, [X', X'] is a singular matrix.
+    """
+    model, X, y, _, coef_with_intercept, coef_without_intercept, alpha = glm_dataset
