+    --------
+    numpy.partition : Return a partitioned copy of an array.
+    argpartition : Indirect partition.
+    sort : Full sort.
+
+    Notes
+    -----
+    See ``np.partition`` for notes on the different algorithms.
+
+    Examples
+    --------
+    >>> import numpy as np
+    >>> a = np.array([3, 4, 2, 1])
+    >>> a.partition(3)
+    >>> a
+    array([2, 1, 3, 4]) # may vary
+
+    >>> a.partition((1, 3))
+    >>> a
+    array([1, 2, 3, 4])
+
+    """))
